("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateDeliberateNonAssertion" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateCounterpartNonTransitive" (lit "true"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateDeliberateNonAssertion" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateFrameRelativity" (lit "true"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateDeliberateNonAssertion" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateIntentNotEntailed" (lit "true"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateDeliberateNonAssertion" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateNoOverTyping" (lit "true"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateDeliberateNonAssertion" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateSocialInformationOverlap" (lit "true"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateBullshitTruthIndifference" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:bullshit's skos:definition, which states the standpoint asserts with indifference to truth-value (Frankfurt) (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateCounterpartNonTransitive" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:counterpartOf's skos:definition, which states it is symmetric but deliberately not transitive (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateCrossNodeGlut" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:findingAnchor's skos:definition, which states the anchor is the join key for cross-node glut detection: a reasoner joins two different-code findings at one place and detects an opposing-polarity conflict the same-fingerprint merge misses (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateDeceptionHeldProjectedDivergence" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:eventTypeDeception's skos:definition, which states that a deception projects a standpoint diverging from the one actually held (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateDiagnosticMetaExtensibility" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:DiagnosticMetaRule's skos:definition, which states the reasoner enumerates every gmeow:DiagnosticMetaRule and applies it, so a new meta-finding is added by authoring a new tagged rule with zero engine change (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateEndurantPerdurantDisjoint" (lit "hand-harvested from the logic:Endurant skos:definition, which contrasts logic:Perdurant, which has temporal parts (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateEntitySortalCovering" (lit "read from gmeow:Entity's gmeow:howToUse annotation, which enumerates the four sortals (Agent, InformationObject, PhysicalObject, SocialObject); the covering is realized in the OWL projection (owl:unionOf), is non-monotone, and is disclosed in the loss ledger — NOT natively enforced (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateEventSituationDisjoint" (lit "doc-section/foundation harvest over the occurrent structure (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, the occurrent section), NOT a single annotation-field harvest — the Event/Situation contrast is spread across the occurrent design prose; anchored to logic:Event's skos:definition for drift detection"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateFalsehoodIsRefutedClaim" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:refuted's skos:definition, which states the standpoint DENIES the proposition (□¬, settled-false-in-frame) (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateFindingCluster" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:FindingCluster's skos:definition, which states it is a grouping of findings that share one gmeow:findingRootCause, its members linked by gmeow:findingCluster and its shared root carried by gmeow:clusterRoot (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateFindingRootCause" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:findingRootCause's skos:definition, which states the root is a childless witness reached by following gmeow:findingAntecedent transitively up the witness DAG, honestly the shared root antecedent and not a lowest-common-dominator (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateFindingTraces" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:findingAntecedent's skos:definition, which states the reasoner can join up the witness DAG for root-cause analysis and a childless finding up the chain is a root antecedent (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateFrameRelativity" (lit "hand-harvested from logic:referenceFrame's skos:definition, which states a logic:measuredValue with no logic:referenceFrame is the logic:MeasurementFrameMissing violation (Principle 11; design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateFunctionalComplexKindDisjoint" (lit "hand-harvested from the logic:FunctionalComplex skos:definition, which contrasts it against logic:Collection and logic:Quantity (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateGateFatalVerdict" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:findingGateVerdict's skos:definition, which states the verdict is derived on exactly the principal up-set ↑(Error, Blocking, Binding) of the truth ordering, mirroring the Rust gmeow_errors::grade::gate() morphism (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateIndirectContributor" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:indirectContributor's skos:definition, which states an entity's indirect contributors are the agents reached by composing gmeow:wasGeneratedBy with gmeow:wasAssociatedWith (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateInstantiatesWork" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:instantiatesWork's skos:definition, which states an Item instantiates the Work reached by composing gmeow:exemplifies, gmeow:embodies and gmeow:realizes across the WEMI spine (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateIntentNotEntailed" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:deceptiveIntentClaim's gmeow:avoidWhen, which states never let the reasoner entail deceptiveness (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateLicensedFalsehoodNotDeception" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:veridicalityLicensedFalsehood's skos:definition, which states the licensed-falsehood safety property separates fiction/satire/sarcasm from deception (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateNoOverTyping" (lit "hand-harvested from logic:MixIden's skos:definition, which states a sortal inherits its principle of identity from exactly one Kind and tracing to two-or-more Kinds violates it (Principle 9; design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateObjectIndividuationCovering" (lit "anchored to logic:Object's skos:definition; completes the individuation-kind pairwise disjointness (logic:candidateFunctionalComplexKindDisjoint) into a partition, realized in the OWL projection (owl:unionOf), non-monotone, disclosed in the loss ledger — NOT natively enforced (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateOrgMembershipPropagation" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:memberOf's skos:definition, which states membership propagates up the organizational part/whole hierarchy via the property chain with gmeow:subOrganizationOf (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateProperPartOfAsymmetric" (lit "hand-harvested from the logic:properPartOf skos:definition (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateRelatorMediation" (lit "hand-harvested from the logic:Relator skos:definition, which states a Relator must mediate at least two distinct entities (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateSocialInformationOverlap" (lit "hand-harvested from the gmeow:SocialObject skos:definition, which states no disjointness with InformationObject is asserted so that socially-sustained narratives may carry information content without identity clash (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateTenureClaimSurfacing" (lit "hand-harvested from gmeow:StandpointTenure's skos:definition, which states the tenureStandpoint maps to the generated claim's vantage and the tenurePosition maps to its observedFeature (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
("https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenance" "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateTopSortalDisjoint" (lit "hand-harvested from the gmeow:PhysicalObject gmeow:avoidWhen annotation, which states the three other sortals are disjoint with PhysicalObject by design (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, §Typed formalization governance)"))
